  "statement": "Build 014b (the power-cycle fix alone): \"Smoke test is all good\", including assigning without saving and a power cycle, with the assignments kept. Build 5.0f with CC Names: \"ERR is gone, names show correctly now\"; \"the midi cc knobs send fine to my synth\". A paste report was withdrawn: \"My mistake the midi CCs werent assigned on the midi page\". After the 0.1.4 checklist (power cycle without saving, SAVE PROJECT then LOAD PROJECT, a CC knob letting go on leaving, NO and pattern change, sequencer trigs on the MIDI track, an LFO on a CC VAL and Overbridge, OS release): \"Everything seems good\", \"I have performed all those tests on 1.53\", \"So a recorded CC trig value always superceeds the perform mode value\". Smoke tests: \"those tests look good on 1.53\", \"I have already smoke tested 1.54\".",
